LLM Observability, Monitoring & Troubleshooting Runbook

Purpose
This document provides a unified production runbook and interview preparation guide for AI/LLM platform observability, monitoring, troubleshooting, profiling, and remediation.

Core Philosophy
Observe → Classify → Isolate → Investigate → Profile → Fix

Layer 1 – Observability Posture (Single Pane of Glass)

Goal
Detect issues before customers notice them.

Architecture
User Experience
    ↓
Application
    ↓
LLM Runtime
    ↓
Kubernetes
    ↓
GPU/CPU/Memory
    ↓
Network
    ↓
Storage
    ↓
Hardware

Minimal Tool Stack
- Prometheus + Grafana (single pane of glass)
- kube-state-metrics
- node-exporter
- DCGM Exporter
- vLLM Metrics Endpoint
- eBPF / CNI Metrics

